#80000
"At the Bottom of a Massive Chasm"
"Huge stalagmites have formed over the years, creating a forest of impassable
rock in most places.  Bones are piled haphazardly on the floor, some so old
they crumble to dust beneath your feet.  The air is still, and reeks of
decomposing flesh.  Clefts in the rock wall to the north lead to a ledge far
above you.  Stalagmites block any passage west, but there is a clearing from
east to south to move about in.
"
"[Ahni] Climb acode
"
