#80024
"A Simple Bedroom"
"The sterile cleanliness of this small room is incongruous with the filth of
the surrounding area.  Sturdy wooden walls have been erected, complete with
ceiling and floor to make this room appear as if it were part of a house, were
it not for the lack of windows.  Simple whitewashed furniture decorates the
room, along with tapestries of woodland scenes.  A thick, shaggy rug covers
most of the floor from bed to desk.  A small cast-iron wood stove is set
against the wall opposite the bed.
"
"[Ahni] Sister's room, clues to find her.
[Ahni] Search desk acode.
"
