"wooden walls ceiling floor rug"
"The walls and ceiling are painted a gentle off-white color, with no evident
signs of wear, such as peeling or cracking.  The floor appears to be made of
the same type of wood, smoothed and varnished with a deep brown color.  The
rug is dark blue with flecks of white, and a good two inches thick, looking to
be very comfortable to walk on barefoot.
"
E
"furniture desk cast-iron stove"
"The furniture is simply, yet sturdily made with some amount of care.  While
there are no carvings or fancy decorations, they have been whitewashed and the
lines are true.  A small dark-varnished writing desk stands out from the rest
of the furniture against the western wall.  Though the room is kept pristine,
a very fine layer of dust can be found on the furniture, as if the room has
not been occupied for a week or two.  The stove is made of heavy cast-iron,
using wood as a heating source.  A large frying pan rests on the top, also
with a fine layer of dust inside.
"
E
"desk"
"This small writing desk stands apart from the rest of the room as it has been
varnished a dark brown color.  Neat stacks of papers and books rest atop the
desk, as well as several quills and pots of various colored ink.  All of this
is covered by an almost imperceptible layer of dust.
"
